Subject: [SP12 r2 local] media: use 7.3.1 subdev selection callback API
Base: authenticated CachyOS 7.3.1-1 source.
Reason: the rebased ov02c10_get_selection callback carried an unused
v4l2_subdev_client_info argument that is absent from the pinned kernel's
v4l2_subdev_pad_ops.get_selection type. Remove only that argument. No upstream
authorship or sign-off is claimed.

---
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/ov02c10.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/ov02c10.c
@@ -760,7 +760,6 @@
 }
 
 static int ov02c10_get_selection(struct v4l2_subdev *sd,
-				 const struct v4l2_subdev_client_info *ci,
 				 struct v4l2_subdev_state *sd_state,
 				 struct v4l2_subdev_selection *sel)
 {
